# test: prelude / Console / println at the top level of a script is valid
# Spec 10 Console: module.console.println-script (MHP-1 second round). A
# script's top level runs no driver, and only non-entry module initialization
# bans block_on, so println there needs only the script's inferred Console row.
greeting := "hello"
println(greeting)
println("done")
